{"id": "clm:e35307bb49682fd20c3bcf86e2e67b643defb5b11777d533ac8d51d69a3b1a76", "type": "statement", "text": "In Atlas, $sessionWindow runs a nested aggregation pipeline over each session and releases its results to the next stage when that window closes. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/windows.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:e972720a7904a1cb9bcb17fca88d382eb98f819fae1c51f69813a5da23b47d60"]}
{"id": "clm:092992e358168c7bf2c7e460679fb6569c51cc84ed1f1fbd75c7d8efe1611b2f", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas event-time sessions close when the watermark advances beyond the session’s maximum event timestamp plus gap and allowedLateness. Their start is the earliest event timestamp; their end is the latest event timestamp plus gap. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:e972720a7904a1cb9bcb17fca88d382eb98f819fae1c51f69813a5da23b47d60"]}
{"id": "clm:e3d7c3f5c1b6c47caee86c6224122eac79871115cbccaf11d408b75a97c5c468", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas sends documents to the DLQ when partitionBy evaluation fails, or when an event is older than the latest source watermark and has no open session. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:908c4873f2495e3a1b991163fe3bb6063f195d945f1f2f423bab043dcaac85f4"]}
{"id": "clm:20ba03e9976b965131b0913780e9901473a27a076ada47f928a3b0470d18739c", "type": "statement", "text": "A practical Atlas pattern groups shopping activity by user, aggregates each session, and triggers downstream abandoned-cart actions after inactivity. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/blog/post/product-release-announcements/mongodb-atlas-stream-processing-now-supports-session-windows", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5578f1146272bfd25876b12b4dc852c8c67364169309ec475fb61b79b0507767", "ev:aaa596e12e2b5cc8d5c4fd3f6356a73b55cc1cd2863f34663516062b88e8f9ac"]}
{"id": "clm:14b55356075e23efcdd415956487372e2daa996653e7b709b73a0aee3d1fa537", "type": "statement", "text": "Session windows group activity into variable-length sessions separated by an inactivity gap; partitioning by user or device keeps each entity’s sessions independent. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://spark.apache.org/docs/latest/streaming/apis-on-dataframes-and-datasets.html", "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/stream-analytics-query/session-window-azure-stream-analytics"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:2740f9c6e25a66650f70655939969324dd69580563630f67002ceef44c592f3c", "ev:e972720a7904a1cb9bcb17fca88d382eb98f819fae1c51f69813a5da23b47d60"]}
{"id": "clm:5ee27cd4e6c704f13433ef02bec17ba8aa3ca1757cee39b6e10a76121d885597", "type": "statement", "text": "An out-of-order Atlas event can bridge and merge two open sessions belonging to the same partition. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:d26275a46e1d16934ee30d7144f57a40f95ad57f87fb78e0745ad4ecae2ea0e0"]}
{"id": "clm:ca36420aaed7af1706bc47a5be52f2138a5f31c8dac0968159c123af15bff0fd", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas requires gap and pipeline. partitionBy is optional: omission puts every document into one null partition. Only a single field or simple expression is supported, not multi-key embedded documents. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3cc231374880001ffa73c4e0b5e7519541b8a01fdcfb7c2ab0771cdff461fcb1"]}
{"id": "clm:8a3c3e7eb6c6a971353066daa9c0020e442c5f7363df673bcfef81322185f640", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas defaults boundary to eventTime and allowedLateness to three seconds; specifying allowedLateness with boundary: processingTime is prohibited. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b1f925c347240e7717fc2c4fdda695773073c9c85ffb2d1263bce119af4dfc2a", "ev:f5e65d2d33680a9a9cf421df80d9dfff380a0b8d409824880f7f0ece35195eaf"]}
{"id": "clm:760b1cd16fa1192dbf3144ef16161aa302c1104a6fde04d1c67807962f990929", "type": "statement", "text": "Do not assume session APIs are interchangeable: Azure exposes timeout and maximum duration, while Atlas’s documented $sessionWindow parameters expose gap and allowedLateness without a maximum-duration parameter. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/stream-analytics-query/session-window-azure-stream-analytics", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3cc231374880001ffa73c4e0b5e7519541b8a01fdcfb7c2ab0771cdff461fcb1", "ev:ff7098da84b22c64c498bf75658a0ccc8f5b006fb7ef34463013ffe75bbb610b"]}
{"id": "clm:2fb829ce02cad23c98e229501e9727acd1ba7836cc05bcbe6c3a3553a0e03f6d", "type": "statement", "text": "Implementation semantics differ: Azure documents a maximum-duration parameter, while Spark accepts dynamic per-row gaps. Neither option appears in the cited Atlas session-stage syntax. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)", "source_url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/stream-analytics-query/session-window-azure-stream-analytics", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Session Windows"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://spark.apache.org/docs/latest/streaming/apis-on-dataframes-and-datasets.html", "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/atlas-stream-processing/sp-agg-session.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbdce0772f41f46574bb9a99746d0960df2953d38398aaa82f1d18fc5fc7208f", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3cc231374880001ffa73c4e0b5e7519541b8a01fdcfb7c2ab0771cdff461fcb1", "ev:dad124a2bde0b75ce03867c3b5c1f1211e4c83f7d0f0ab4cf79eecbfe8968c39", "ev:ff7098da84b22c64c498bf75658a0ccc8f5b006fb7ef34463013ffe75bbb610b"]}
